        {
          "path": "licenses/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt",
          "byteCount": 1142,
          "sha256": "b076bc0ff98d8233ffdf03426889395d67228d0428d3f2bf735c475603d35578",
          "content": "Spoken Margins on-device voice notices\n\nSupertonic 3 model and preset voice styles\nCopyright (c) 2026 Supertone Inc.\nLicensed under BigScience Open RAIL-M. The complete license is included as\nSUPERTONIC_MODEL_OPENRAIL-M.txt.\n\nSupertonic Swift inference code\nCopyright (c) 2026 Supertone Inc.\nAdapted from https://github.com/supertone-inc/supertonic and licensed under\nthe MIT License included as SUPERTONIC_CODE_MIT.txt.\n\nINT8 model conversion\nThe bundled ONNX graphs are modified, quantized derivatives of Supertonic 3.\nThey were produced by the k2-fsa sherpa-onnx project from Supertone's public\nONNX assets. Spoken Margins renamed the graph files for the official Swift\nruntime contract and packaged them with the official configuration, Unicode\nindex, and preset voice-style files. The sherpa-onnx Apache 2.0 license is\nincluded as SHERPA_ONNX_APACHE-2.0.txt.\n\nONNX Runtime\nCopyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.\nLicensed under the MIT License included as ONNXRUNTIME_MIT.txt. Notices for\nits bundled third-party software are included in\nONNXRUNTIME_THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.\n\nNo Supertone, sherpa-onnx, or Microsoft endorsement is implied.\n"
        }
