          "content": "Phonon 31M (English), Core ML bundle\nCopyright Gradium. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n(licenses/LICENSE-APACHE.txt in this folder).\n\nWhere these files come from:\n- The Core ML bundle phonon-31m-en-coreml.zip, a release asset of\n  https://github.com/gradium-ai/xn-ptts at tag v0.4.2 (commit cc0c32bc),\n  exported by Gradium from the model gradium/phonon-31m-en at revision\n  8acf8881 and the voices gradium/phonon-voices at revision da6c9ec0, both\n  published on Hugging Face under the Apache License 2.0.\n- The runtime that reads them is Gradium's ptts package (xn-ptts v0.4.2),\n  dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; Spoken Margins uses it under Apache-2.0.\n\nThe audio codec (mimi-c266.mlpackage) is Gradium's Core ML export of a Mimi\ndecoder, published as gradium/phonon-mimi under the Apache License 2.0. Mimi\nwas created by Kyutai (https://github.com/kyutai-labs/moshi), whose original\nMimi weights are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0\nInternational (licenses/CC-BY-4.0.txt). Credit: Mimi codec by Kyutai.\n\nChanges made by Spoken Margins: none to any file's bytes. The download\ntakes 25 of the bundle's 38 voices (the catalogue voices; the 12 character\nvoices and the \"default\" copy are left out), and each file is checked\nagainst the SHA-256 Gradium lists in bundle.json.\n"
